{"version":1,"type":"html","title":"人员繁忙程度热力图","content":"<main style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:22px 26px;font-family:sans-serif;color:#263445\"><h1 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-0.5px;margin:0 0 5px\">人员繁忙程度</h1><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:12px;color:#758398;margin:0 0 18px\">统计周期：2026-11-30—2026-12-04 · 报告日期：2026-11-26 · 基于会议后排期 · 按总体负载降序</p><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;gap:10px;margin:0 0 20px\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:1;background:#fff1ef;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;color:#b63336\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px;margin-right:7px\">3 / 6</strong><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">人超负荷</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:1;background:#f5f7fb;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px;margin-right:7px\">44 h</strong><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">个人正缺口合计</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:1;background:#f5f7fb;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px;margin-right:7px\">176 / 184 h</strong><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">团队已排 / 可用 · 负载95.7%</span></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11px;color:#64748b;margin:0 0 12px\"><span style=\"background:#e5f2ef;color:#267466;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:3px\">有余量 &lt;80%</span><span style=\"background:#fff1ce;color:#89641f;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:3px\">较满 80–100%</span><span style=\"background:#ffe1cc;color:#a14c22;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:3px\">超负荷 &gt;100–150%</span><span style=\"background:#bd3d49;color:white;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:3px\">严重超负荷 &gt;150%</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto\"><table style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;min-width:670px;border-spacing:6px;border-collapse:separate;font-size:13px\"><thead style=\"color:#66768a;font-size:12px\"><tr><th